# Scheduled jobs for the self-hosted deployment.
#
# These are the same twelve jobs that apps/web/vercel.json registers for the
# hosted deployment. The job list is kept in lockstep, and
# apps/web/lib/__tests__/cron-schedules.test.ts fails when this file,
# vercel.json, apps/web/wrangler.jsonc, apps/web/cloudflare/worker.mjs and the
# routes under apps/web/app/api/cron/ disagree about which jobs exist.
#
# Three schedules are more frequent here than on Vercel, on purpose: the hosted
# account's plan allows each cron at most once a day, and the container has no
# such rule.
#   publish   every 15 minutes, so a site's local publish time is reached
#             whatever its timezone (the cadence gate is "at or after").
#   analyze   every 10 minutes, so a new workspace is analysed soon after signup.
#   generate  four times a day (01, 07, 13, 19 UTC). Each run writes at most two
#             drafts across every workspace, so one run a day caps the whole
#             install at about fourteen drafts a week. Hosted gets the same
#             four runs from .github/workflows/generate-cron.yml.
#
# Every route authenticates with the `x-cron-secret` header and refuses the
# request when CRON_SECRET is unset, so this file does nothing useful until that
# variable is set in docker/.env. That is deliberate: an unauthenticated
# scheduler endpoint on a self-hosted box is a worse failure than no schedule.
#
# `-fsS` so curl stays quiet on success but still reports a real failure to the
# container log, and `--max-time` so a hung request cannot overlap the next tick.

*/15 * * * *    altorank-cron publish
*/10 * * * *    altorank-cron analyze
0 3 * * *       altorank-cron serp
20 3 * * *      altorank-cron serp-collect
0 4 * * *       altorank-cron analytics
0 5 * * *       altorank-cron exchange
0 1,7,13,19 * * *  altorank-cron generate
30 7 * * *      altorank-cron refresh
0 8 * * 1       altorank-cron geo
0 6 1 * *       altorank-cron reports
0 10 * * *      altorank-cron site-pages
0 11 * * *      altorank-cron ops-digest
30 8 * * *      altorank-cron shopify-billing
